-A path that names no tool is returned in `missing` with the closest paths.
-Hosted exposes tools generated from its OpenAPI spec under `tools.pluginEngine`.
-Self-host serves the same API as PluginEngine Cloud, so follow the hosted examples
-there; the local examples are for PluginEngine on the user's own machine.
